{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/breez-danube-properties-maritime-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1325,"crm_id":"6379","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Breez","slug":"breez-danube-properties-maritime-city","display_address":"Dubai Maritime City","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Danube Properties","price":1310000,"display_price":"1.31M","lattitude":25.26532,"longitude":55.268898,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":"1,2,3,4","about":"<p>Breez by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-danube-properties/\">Danube Properties</a> is a 60-floor residential tower located in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/maritime-city/\">Dubai Maritime City</a>. Designed as a symbol of modern coastal elegance, the development offers fully furnished oceanfront homes that combine contemporary architecture with breathtaking sea views.</p><p>Every detail at Breez reflects Danube Properties’ commitment to quality and innovation. With over 40 resort-style amenities, residents can indulge in a lifestyle that’s both active and tranquil, surrounded by panoramic views and world-class facilities.&nbsp;</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_8464e9dca8.jpg","hash":"Feature_8464e9dca8","name":"Breeze by Danube Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_741b83903e.jpg","hash":"Banner_741b83903e","name":"Breez by Danube Banner"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_15_f8be4ace11.jpg","hash":"Gallery_15_f8be4ace11","name":"Gallery-15.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-w