and investor confidence.</li><li>Fully Furnished Residences - Every home at Breez is elegantly furnished, featuring refined finishes and smart convertible layouts that maximize space and comfort.</li><li>World-Class Amenities - Featuring over 40 amenities, the project is designed to enhance daily life; from infinity pools and floating cabanas to fitness zones, spas, and children’s play areas.</li><li>Exceptional Connectivity - The project enjoys close proximity to Port Rashid, Dubai Cruise Terminal, and major city landmarks like Burj Khalifa and Dubai World Trade Centre.</li><li>High Rental Potential - Its prime waterfront address and resort-style appeal make Breez a lucrative choice for both long-term investors and short-term rental opportunities.</li><li>Architectural Excellence - The tower’s design celebrates maritime aesthetics, featuring a grand aquarium lobby, waterfall atrium, and premium finishes that reflect seaside serenity.</li><li>Upcoming Infrastructure Advantage - The area’s development plans, including a proposed mall and upcoming metro station, further strengthen Breez’s long-term investment potential.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1886,"cta":{"id":2696,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":null,"isExternal":false,"custom_link":null},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Breez_by_Danube_Map_Location_52bff50a56.jpg","hash":"Breez_by_Danube_Map_Location_52bff50a56","name":"Breez by Danube Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Prime Waterfront Location in Dubai Maritime City","heading":"Breez Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Set along the waterfront between Port Rashid and Dubai’s iconic skyline, Breez offers a location that perfectly balances tranquility and accessibility. Just minutes from Meena Bazaar, Jumeirah Beach, and Dubai World Trade Centre, residents enjoy seamless access to entertainment